@startuml virtual_ef800
title Virtual EF800 — Runtime Deployment
left to right direction

node "Developer workstation" {
  actor Browser
  node "Docker Compose" {
    node "Virtual EF800 container" as sim {
      artifact "Zephyr native_sim\nEF800 Application" as firmware
      component "Emulated GPIO / I2C / RTC\nUART / QSPI / LCD" as emulators
      component "Virtual USB UDC + host peer" as usb
    }
    node "Web gateway container" as web {
      component "HTTP + WebSocket API" as api
      component "Bounded simulator client" as client
    }
  }
  node "EF800_Devcontainer" as dev {
    artifact "west / toolchain / Twister" as tools
  }
}

Browser <--> api : 127.0.0.1:8080
api --> client
client <--> firmware : private TCP :8800
firmware --> emulators
firmware --> usb
tools ..> firmware : builds
note bottom of client
  Gateway owns the private simulator connection.
  Browser does not access simulator storage directly.
end note
@enduml
